# Drop the LiteRT-LM bundle for Gemma 4 E2B int4 here:
#
#   assets/models/gemma4_e2b_int4.litertlm
#
# (Base Camp previously targeted Gemma 4 E4B; the runtime contract is
# identical between the two variants, but the .litertlm bundles are
# variant-specific — do not rename an E4B bundle into the E2B path.)
#
# The file is gitignored (see /.gitignore). The app will refuse to leave
# the first-boot gate until this file is present, either bundled here
# or pushed to the app-specific external files dir on Android.
